#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/at-spi2-core.xml:93
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of At-Spi2 Core"
msgstr "Instalação do At-Spi2 Core"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/at-spi2-core.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>At-Spi2 Core</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>At-Spi2 Core</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/at-spi2-core.xml:100
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..            \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release \\\n"
"      -D systemd_user_dir=/tmp &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup ..            \\\n"
"      --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release \\\n"
"      -D systemd_user_dir=/tmp &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/at-spi2-core.xml:109
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr --buildtype=release .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/at-spi2-core.xml:116
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/at-spi2-core.xml:119
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/at-spi2-core.xml:120
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>ninja install &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm /tmp/at-spi-dbus-bus.service</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>ninja install &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm /tmp/at-spi-dbus-bus.service</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/at-spi2-core.xml:124
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The test suite requires the glib schemas of the package to be installed "
"already. The tests also need to run in a graphical environment. Now that the"
" package is installed, test the results by issuing: <command>dbus-run-"
"session ninja test</command>."
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste exige que os esquemas da glib do pacote já estejam "
"instalados. Os testes também precisam executar em um ambiente gráfico. Agora"
" que o pacote está instalado, teste os resultados emitindo: <command>dbus-"
"run-session ninja test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/at-spi2-core.xml:133
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/at-spi2-core.xml:139
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D systemd_user_dir=/tmp</parameter>: This flag puts the systemd "
"unit file in /tmp where it will be removed. SysV is unable to use this file."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D systemd_user_dir=/tmp</parameter>: Esse sinalizador coloca o "
"arquivo da unidade do systemd em /tmp onde será removido. O SysV é inapto "
"para usar esse arquivo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/at-spi2-core.xml:145
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D docs=true</option>: Use this switch if you want to build the "
"documentation. Note that you must have both <xref role=\"nodep\" "
"linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/> and <xref linkend='sphinx'/> installed on your "
"system."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D docs=true</option>: Use essa chave se você quiser construir a "
"documentação. Observe que você precisa ter <xref role=\"nodep\" "
"linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/> e <xref linkend='sphinx'/> instalados em teu "
"sistema."

